# Released bodies of the harness files a project may vendor into its fuzz directory:
# <harness commit> <file> <sha256 of the file as it is in the harness at that commit>
# A vendored copy carries a comment header naming the commit ("Vendored from fv-harness <commit>");
# run_fuzz.sh FAILs COUPLE unless the copy below its header hashes to the line for that commit.
# A release tag (vX.Y.Z) must match exactly; a commit id may be abbreviated. Add lines for every
# release, and for every commit that changes one of these files.
